   "rules": [
    {
     "title": "Das deutsche Alphabet",
     "html": "<h3>Nemis tili alifbosi</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Harf</th><th>Nomi</th><th>Harf</th><th>Nomi</th><th>Harf</th><th>Nomi</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A a</td><td>A (ah)</td><td>B b</td><td>Be (bay)</td><td>C c</td><td>Ce (tsay)</td></tr><tr><td>D d</td><td>De (day)</td><td>E e</td><td>E (ay)</td><td>F f</td><td>Ef (eff)</td></tr><tr><td>G g</td><td>Ge (gay)</td><td>H h</td><td>Ha (hah)</td><td>I i</td><td>I (eeh)</td></tr><tr><td>J j</td><td>Jott / Je (yot)</td><td>K k</td><td>Ka (kah)</td><td>L l</td><td>El (ell)</td></tr><tr><td>M m</td><td>Em (em)</td><td>N n</td><td>En (en)</td><td>O o</td><td>O (oh)</td></tr><tr><td>P p</td><td>Pe (pay)</td><td>Q q</td><td>Qu / Que (koo)</td><td>R r</td><td>Er (err)</td></tr><tr><td>S s</td><td>Es (es)</td><td>T t</td><td>Te (tay)</td><td>U u</td><td>U (ooh)</td></tr><tr><td>V v</td><td>Vau (fow)</td><td>W w</td><td>We (vay)</td><td>X x</td><td>Ix (iks)</td></tr><tr><td>Y y</td><td>Ypsilon (oopsilohn)</td><td>Z z</td><td>Zett (tset)</td><td>Ä ä</td><td>Ä (eh)</td></tr><tr><td>Ö ö</td><td>Ö (ouh)</td><td>Ü ü</td><td>Ü (uuh)</td><td>ß</td><td>Eszett (ess-set)</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
     "title": "Nemis alifbosidagi muhim harflar",
     "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>Harf</th><th>Qoida</th><th>Misollar</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>C c</td><td>a, o, u yoki undoshdan oldin — [k]; e, i, ä, ö, ü oldidan — [ts]</td><td>Café [kafe], Clown [klawn]; Cent [tsent], Cinema [tsinema]</td></tr><tr><td>H h</td><td>So'z boshida yoki unli oldida [h]; ikki unli orasida talaffuz qilinmaydi, oldingi unlini cho'zadi</td><td>Haus [haus] (uy), heute [hoyte] (bugun); sehen [ze:en] (ko'rmoq), gehen [ge:en] (bormoq); Uhr [u:a] (soat), Zahn [tsa:n] (tish)</td></tr><tr><td>J j</td><td>Asli nemischa so'zlarda [y]; xorijiy so'zlarda [ʒ] (o'zbekcha J)</td><td>Jahr [ya:r] (yil), Junge [yunge] (bola); Job (ish), Joggen (yugurish), Jeans (jinsi)</td></tr><tr><td>Q q</td><td>Har doim [kv]</td><td>Qualität [kvali'te:t] (sifat), Quelle [kvele] (manba)</td></tr><tr><td>R r</td><td>So'z boshida yoki undoshdan keyin tomoqdan chiqadigan [ʁ]; so'z yoki bo'g'in oxirida ko'pincha [ɐ] ga yaqin</td><td>Rot (qizil), Brief (xat); Lehrer (o'qituvchi), Mutter (ona)</td></tr><tr><td>S s</td><td>So'z boshida unli oldidan [z]; so'z oxiri yoki undosh oldidan [s]; sp — [shp], st — [sht]</td><td>Sonne [zone] (quyosh), sieben [zi:ben] (yetti); Haus [haus], ist [ist]; Sport [shport], Straße [shtra:se], Student [shtudent]</td></tr><tr><td>V v</td><td>Ko'pincha [f]; ba'zi xorijiy so'zlarda [v]</td><td>Vater [fa:ter] (ota), Volk [folk] (xalq); Video, Virus</td></tr><tr><td>W w</td><td>Har doim [v]</td><td>Wasser [vaser] (suv), Winter [vinter] (qish)</td></tr><tr><td>Y y</td><td>Ko'pincha [ü] yoki [i]; ba'zi xorijiy so'zlarda [y]</td><td>Physik [füzik] (fizika), Psychologie (psixologiya); Yoga [jo:ga]</td></tr><tr><td>Z z</td><td>Har doim [ts]</td><td>Zeit [tsayt] (vaqt), Zimmer [tsimmer] (xona)</td></tr><tr><td>Ä ä</td><td>„a“ va „e“ oralig'idagi tovush</td><td>Mädchen [me:dchen] (qizcha)</td></tr><tr><td>Ö ö</td><td>„o“ va „e“ aralash tovush</td><td>schön [shø:n] (chiroyli)</td></tr><tr><td>Ü ü</td><td>„u“ va „i“ aralash tovush</td><td>Tür [ty:r] (eshik)</td></tr><tr><td>ß</td><td>Eszett („scharfes S“) — har doim [s]</td><td>Straße [shtra:se] (ko'cha), Fußball [fu:sbal] (futbol)</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
     "title": "Harf birikmalari va diftonglar",
     "html": "<h3>A. Harf birikmalari (undoshlar birikmasi)</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Birikma</th><th>O'qilishi</th><th>Misollar</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ch</td><td>[ç] (ich); a, o, u, au dan keyin [x]; ba'zi xorijiy so'zlarda [k]</td><td>ich (men), Küche (oshxona); Bach (soy), Buch (kitob); Charakter (xarakter)</td></tr><tr><td>sch</td><td>[sh]</td><td>Schule [shu:le] (maktab), Schnee [shne:] (qor)</td></tr><tr><td>sp</td><td>[shp]</td><td>Sport [shport] (sport), Sprache [shpra:xe] (til)</td></tr><tr><td>st</td><td>[sht]</td><td>Student [shtudent] (talaba), Stadt [shtat] (shahar)</td></tr><tr><td>ph</td><td>[f]</td><td>Philosophie (falsafa), Physik (fizika)</td></tr><tr><td>th</td><td>[t]</td><td>Theater [teater] (teatr), Thema [tema] (mavzu)</td></tr><tr><td>ck</td><td>[k]</td><td>Jacke [yake] (kurtka), Zucker [tsuker] (shakar)</td></tr><tr><td>ng</td><td>[ŋ]</td><td>singen (kuylamoq), Finger (barmoq)</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>B. Diftonglar (ikki unli tovush birikmasi)</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Diftong</th><th>O'qilishi</th><th>Misollar</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ei / ai</td><td>[ay]</td><td>mein [mayn] (mening), Kaiser (imperator)</td></tr><tr><td>eu / äu</td><td>[oy]</td><td>neu [noy] (yangi), Häuser [hoyzer] (uylar), Europa, Eule (boyo'g'li)</td></tr><tr><td>au</td><td>[au]</td><td>Haus [haus] (uy), Auto [auto] (mashina)</td></tr><tr><td>ie</td><td>[i:] (cho'ziq i)</td><td>Liebe [li:be] (muhabbat), vier [fi:r] (to'rt)</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    }
   ],
